TITLE:: CompressorMeterView
summary:: input, output and the gain change, as bars
categories:: Libraries>Compressor
related:: Classes/Compressor, Classes/CompressorPanel

DESCRIPTION::
Three bars: input and output in dB down to -60, and the gain change hanging
from the top, up or down alike, on a scale that grows to fit. Each has a hold
mark that falls back on its own; click to drop them. Red above 0 dB.

